                        "form": "моложа́вы"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35cf3971-3c9e-3972-a91f-a82592cb3621",
                        "entry_id": "cae74b84-778d-37eb-8468-fb78b5365e26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "young-looking, youthful"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3683021f-1309-4fa2-b20d-6350aa7e6b8e",
                                "sense_id": "35cf3971-3c9e-3972-a91f-a82592cb3621",
                                "text": "Он был невели́к ро́стом, то́нок, моложа́в, — так моложа́в и румя́н, что подча́с каза́лся ма́льчиком, прикле́ившим бо́роду и переня́вшим от взро́слых, дово́льно уда́чно, их пова́дки.",
                                "translation": "He was of low stature, thin, youngish—so youngish and ruddy that now and then he looked like a boy who had glued on a false beard and had assumed grown-up manners with complete success.",
                                "english": "He was of low stature, thin, youngish—so youngish and ruddy that now and then he looked like a boy who had glued on a false beard and had assumed grown-up manners with complete success."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "160a6219-e7e0-4373-8a58-d1668f93e25a",
                                "sense_id": "35cf3971-3c9e-3972-a91f-a82592cb3621",
                                "text": "Роди́вшись, он удиви́лся и так про́жил до ста́рости с голубы́ми глаза́ми на моложа́вом лице́.",
                                "translation": "He had felt surprised at birth and had remained surprised, his eyes light blue in his youthful face, until he was an old man.",
                                "english": "He had felt surprised at birth and had remained surprised, his eyes light blue in his youthful face, until he was an old man."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
